00:13:40.870 --> 00:13:42.730
So [MUTED] here said
that he couldn't

00:13:42.730 --> 00:13:43.690
notice much difference.

00:13:43.690 --> 00:13:44.190
Great.

00:13:44.190 --> 00:13:47.260
So we have some difference
in opinion here already.

00:13:47.260 --> 00:13:50.740
And we reduce the file size
to something like half.

