00:14:08.270 --> 00:14:09.530
Bad voice.

00:14:09.530 --> 00:14:13.230
But you might
still live with it.

00:14:13.230 --> 00:14:15.000
That's fair to say.

00:14:15.000 --> 00:14:17.460
Anyone else, any thoughts?

00:14:17.460 --> 00:14:18.150
Yeah

00:14:18.150 --> 00:14:20.520
