00:14:20.520 --> 00:14:25.140
The last one was much more
shrill and unpleasant.

00:14:25.140 --> 00:14:26.840
Sorry, what's your name?

00:14:26.840 --> 00:14:30.350
So [MUTED] here observed that
the frequencies went down

00:14:30.350 --> 00:14:35.270
and he found that the last one
was a bit shrill and just--

00:14:35.270 --> 00:14:36.890
something was off.

00:14:36.890 --> 00:14:39.800
And again, the point
which I want to highlight

00:14:39.800 --> 00:14:42.110
is that at this point, you
have compressed the file.

00:14:42.110 --> 00:14:45.590
And even in this classroom
which is really small,

00:14:45.590 --> 00:14:49.040
the scale of world, we have
some difference in opinion.

00:14:49.040 --> 00:14:53.120
Maybe [MUTED] said he can live
with 2.5 mb, he doesn't care.

00:14:53.120 --> 00:14:55.040
It's not cool with that.

00:14:55.040 --> 00:14:59.810
Even going from 5.3 to 2.5
mbs, this is my favorite song,

00:14:59.810 --> 00:15:02.780
