00:15:10.700 --> 00:15:12.380
And these are the
real trade offs

00:15:12.380 --> 00:15:14.630
that you face in real world.

00:15:14.630 --> 00:15:16.640
You have to take a call.

00:15:16.640 --> 00:15:21.020
If your phone just have, I don't
