You have to go
down to that size.

00:15:24.020 --> 00:15:27.390
But something interesting
to note was, even at,

00:15:27.390 --> 00:15:29.910
I don't know we reduce
it by roughly five X.

00:15:29.910 --> 00:15:33.030
The audio quality
sounds still OK.

00:15:33.030 --> 00:15:36.120
If that was the space which
you have left in your phone,

00:15:36.120 --> 00:15:37.980
you might still want to keep it.

00:15:37.980 --> 00:15:39.720
But let's say, if
