00:16:15.000 --> 00:16:17.130
Again, let's reduce
the size further.

00:16:17.130 --> 00:16:19.940
And this is at 280kb.

00:16:19.940 --> 00:16:22.740
For me, I am OK.

00:16:22.740 --> 00:16:24.290
Let's reduce the size further.

00:16:24.290 --> 00:16:27.650
And now this is the
same thing at 13kb.

00:16:27.650 --> 00:16:33.020
We have reduced the file size
by, I don't know, around 500x.

00:16:33.020 --> 00:16:34.940
And there are two comments.

00:16:34.940 --> 00:16:36.950
More or less, I
think this is OK.

00:16:36.950 --> 00:16:39.950
This still captures the
