00:16:42.330 --> 00:16:44.730
But if you are a
connoisseur, or if you really

00:16:44.730 --> 00:16:47.790
like to watch a lot
of movies and whatnot.

00:16:47.790 --> 00:16:51.030
Maybe you observe that there
were some distortions which

00:16:51.030 --> 00:16:56.170
