00:33:03.190 --> 00:33:05.440
What does this color space mean?

00:33:05.440 --> 00:33:06.310
Things like this.

00:33:06.310 --> 00:33:08.800
And hopefully, by the
end of all of this,

00:33:08.800 --> 00:33:11.530
you would be able to
appreciate these things

00:33:11.530 --> 00:33:13.836
and understand and make change.

00:33:17.770 --> 00:33:19.990
And then finally,
it's a rich field.

00:33:19.990 --> 00:33:22.540
We are only going to touch
the tip of the iceberg.

00:33:22.540 --> 00:33:26.440
But there are a bunch of
