00:33:42.280 --> 00:33:44.050
Maybe it's not just
about using ML,

00:33:44.050 --> 00:33:46.990
but also, you have
this big neural nets.

00:33:46.990 --> 00:33:49.210
How do you apply
compression to them?

00:33:49.210 --> 00:33:51.400
So it's a two direction thing.

00:33:51.400 --> 00:33:55.810
You can use ML for compression,
or you can compress your ML

00:33:55.810 --> 00:33:57.730
