I will speak for a
bit, introduce what

00:36:01.740 --> 00:36:03.045
lossless compression is about.

00:36:06.730 --> 00:36:09.580
So the plan for the first few
lectures, as Pulkit described,

00:36:09.580 --> 00:36:12.190
is we will cover
a bit of theory.

00:36:12.190 --> 00:36:14.380
Some concepts from
